Co-treatment with prednisolone and RKER-065 increased both muscle mass and strength and trabecular bone and strength

MDX mice were treated with vehicle (Veh) or 2-prednisolone (Pred), or co-treated with 10 mg/kg of prednisolone and RKER-065 twice weekly (Pred+065). Prednisolone-treated MDX mice had less muscle mass and strength than vehicle-treated mice, while co-treatment with prednisolone and RKER-065 increased both muscle mass and strength and trabecular bone and strength.

